# demand_agg_body_1 oracle sidecar: add-only (add_edge is a plain, non-
# @differential message). Pins the definitional in-degree aggregate:
# indeg(Dst) = count of DISTINCT sources Src with edge(Src, Dst).
# Batch 1: two sources into node 2, one source into node 4.
# Batch 2: a third source into node 2 (incremental group growth).
batch
+ add_edge 1 2
+ add_edge 3 2
+ add_edge 5 4
end
batch
+ add_edge 7 2
end
